          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Insurance careers cover selling and advising, underwriting, claims, operations, surveying, analytics and actuarial work, and the strongest long-term careers combine product knowledge with fair customer handling, since mis-selling and claim disputes damage trust and careers quickly."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Pick between selling, assessing risk and settling claims, learn one product line in depth and build a sample case file."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check current licensing rules before you take any role or course."
          }
        ]
      },
